Spec: LinkGate mobile interface delivery

Purpose:
  Deliver the renamed mobile interface and retire explicitly obsolete installations while retaining the active gateway identity.

Owns:
  ./MOBILE-UI.md

References:
  /android/agent/src/main/java/dev/linkgate/agent/android/OwnerActivity.sdd
  ./retire-legacy.sdd

Must:
  Distinguish the Android-only UI release from the unchanged Windows/backend versions and retain previous transport evidence.
  Verify native layouts on an owned emulator only and upgrade the physical phone without operating its screen or deleting the current Agent.
  Record recoverable Windows cleanup and private cloud recovery material separately from active installations.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Rename launcher/notification and provide a coherent native icon and theme.
  [x] #2 Deliver overview, devices, applications and settings with explicit protected approvals.
  [x] #3 Verify responsive layouts, signed upgrade and retained pairing with owner confirmation.
  [x] #4 Retire verified old Android/Windows/cloud installations and preserve the current gateway.
